Package: autoware-model-downloader-1-9-0
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.8), ca-certificates
Suggests: autoware-data-1-9-0
Description: Downloader for the Autoware 1.9.0 ML models
 Provides autoware-download-models-1-9-0, which fetches the ML models used by
 Autoware 1.9.0 from their upstream URLs into a directory owned by the user
 (default: ~/autoware_data, Autoware's default data_path) and verifies each
 file against a recorded sha256.
 .
 The models are not shipped in the local repository. They must sit in a
 user-writable directory anyway, because TensorRT writes its compiled engines
 next to them. For offline installs, the autoware-data-1-9-0 packages carry
 the same files, and the downloader can link them with --link-from.
